  "id": "resourcesat-2a-liss4-mx70-l2",
  "title": "ResourceSat-2A LISS-4 MX70 L2 (Bhoonidhi)",
  "description": "ResourceSat-2A LISS-4 MX70 L2 high-resolution reflectance composites for field analytics over the Bangalore 60 km AOI. LISS-4 MX70 has Green, Red, and NIR bands, so default imagery is FCC (NIR, Red, Green) and supported indices are limited to NDVI, MSAVI, and NDWI_GREEN_NIR. The mask product is Akasha-generated and provisional because no native cloud/quality raster is available.",
  "license": "proprietary",
  "keywords": ["isro", "nrsc", "bhoonidhi", "resourcesat-2a", "liss-4", "mx70", "bangalore", "composite"],
  "providers": [
